# The named-customer half of the PII gate. The names themselves are the thing
# this repo must not publish, so they live here and never in a commit. The
# tracked `.example` alongside it carries fictional names only, and
# test/pov-plugin.test.ts refuses rather than passes when this file is absent.
.pii-identities.local.json

