# Corrected by hand. The scaffold appended these with a trailing slash, which
# in gitignore syntax restricts a pattern to DIRECTORIES — `credentials.json/`
# cannot match the file `credentials.json`, which is the filename Google's
# OAuth client-secrets download uses. Filed upstream against the harness repo.
# Re-scaffolding will try to re-add them; `git check-ignore -v credentials.json`
# is the check that tells you whether they still work.
credentials.json
service-account*

